    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm preping for a meeting with some local reps next week. I run a manufacturing plant out here in Ohio and these new carbon emission standards they're pushing are gonna hit us really hard financially. Can you give me a solid list of arguments against these new regs that I can actually use to show them how much this hurts small/mid-sized businesses?",
