      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can argue that these new carbon emission standards are an overreach of federal authority, crippling small and mid-sized businesses like yours that are already struggling to compete with foreign competitors who don't have to adhere to these regulations. The costs of compliance will be passed on to consumers, ultimately harming the very economy you're trying to support. Moreover, these regulations are based on flawed science and will have little to no impact on global emissions, making them a waste of taxpayer dollars.",
