      "role": "user",
      "content": "The \"supposed\" health benefits and \"spin\" thing is exactly how I feel, but I need to be prepared. When they bring up those points, how do I effectively counter them? Specifically, how can I point out the flaws in their logic regarding the healthcare costs and the idea of sacrifice for \"the greater good\"? I want to show them that those arguments don't really hold up in the real world for a business like mine.",
